<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0b5906c6b7a2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Giorgia Meloni sues father-son duo over pornographic deepfake" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5986" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1548f970af8a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Italian Prime Minister Giorgia Meloni has sought €100,000 (over $100,000) in damages after falling victim to deepfake videos." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5983" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/15b4e0e8eda6> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Deepfakes are a form of synthetic media created using artificial intelligence (AI) to manipulate or generate visual and audio content, often with malicious intent, to appear authentic." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4441" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/16f80bd379d2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The 'Brothers of Italy' co-founder is seeking €100,000 ($109,000) in damages for a pornographic video that has been viewed millions of times on US pornographic sites." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4431" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1cfb23acdd73> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Italy’s Giorgia Meloni called to testify in deepfake porn case" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4428" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2005f1926572> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Deepfakes are a form of artificial intelligence/machine learning (AI/ML) to create believable, realistic videos, pictures, audio, and text of events that never happened, as per US Homeland Security." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4444" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/28d4d0058e5e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Maria Giulia Marongiu, Meloni's legal representative, emphasized that the requested damages serve as a symbolic gesture, aiming to empower women who have fallen victim to such abuses." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4439" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/39e506e6419b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A deepfake video is a fake video in which the face of a person, using Artificial Intelligence, is imposed over someone else's face." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4431" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3c9a758cfb05> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Similar incidents have unfolded across Europe with the emergence of the BikiniOff app. This app is capable of virtually disrobing individuals based on a photograph." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4430" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3f7ba13eb469> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "2 men accused of creating the videos, a father and son duo, aged 74 and 40 respectively, are currently being investigated under defamation charges, comprising a custodial sentence under Italian law." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5983" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4131aeb073f0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "At the time the videos were posted, Meloni, 47, was campaigning to be prime minister as head of her Brothers of Italy party." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4426" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4d29d6a9b834> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The term \"deepfake\" originated in late 2017, as per MIT, when a Reddit user under the same pseudonym established a platform for sharing pornographic content created using open-source face-swapping technology." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4434" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5c8292aa0b9f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Giorgia Meloni seeks 100,000 euros in damages over deepfake porn videos" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4444" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5d90cb5833f4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "It's not just pornography. Several Hollywood big-shots have seen their likeness stolen and used online for other reasons, including actor Tom Hanks, who last year warned fans that he had 'nothing to do with' circulating advertisements for a dental plan using deepfakes." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6678" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5edbb85598af> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "falsified or altered through the use of artificial intelligence systems" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4429" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/684f8e9dd4c3> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The proliferation of modern, powerful image- and video-generating AI tools" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4429" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6b880ccb3554> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Italy's Prime Minister Giorgia Meloni, who became the most popular foreign dignitary on social media in India in recent months, has initiated stern action against the misuse of Artificial Intelligence (AI) through deepfake technology." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4431" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6c419decff0b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[5986] A deepfake video is a fake video in which the face of a person, using Artificial Intelligence, is imposed over someone else's face." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5986" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6e32f8fe93ce> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Italian PM Giorgia Meloni seeks €100,000 compensation over deepfake videos" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4437" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/70c3de39cce9> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "using intelligent tools to assist in money laundering" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4429" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/75ca00668966> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A deepfake video is a fake video in which the face of a person, using Artificial Intelligence, is imposed over someone else's face." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5986" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/76f3f20a95c5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Ashwini Vaishnaw, the IT Minister of India, stated that deepfake video-making organisations have grown as a new threat to democracy and the Indian government is considering bringing in new regulations to safeguard people's identities." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4435" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7c02a6ce7d36> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Giorgia Meloni to Testify Against Deepfake Offenders, Demands $108K" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4430" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/807eca4f74d4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "X eventually removed the images and blocked searches to the pop star's name as Swift was reportedly weighing possible legal action against the website responsible for generating the deepfakes." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4435" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/820ba0ea42cd> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Deepfake leverages artificial intelligence, specifically deep learning, to fabricate images or videos portraying fictitious events." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4434" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/845e543f1502> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A video of Prime Minister Narendra Modi doing a garba dance also made headlines previously." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4435" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/846b4bd84cc2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Italy prime minister Giorgia Meloni is seeking 100,000 euros in damages after deepfake videos of her were created and circulated online." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4445" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/897fa72da97a> a airo:Evidence ;
