    airo:sourceDocId "4436" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/dca0bc12e43c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "2 men accused of creating the videos, a father and son duo, aged 74 and 40 respectively, are currently being investigated under defamation charges, comprising a custodial sentence under Italian law." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5983" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ede8156b6e84> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Italy is set to present legislation to regulate AI later this month, hot on the heels of the EU's landmark AI Act, which the European Parliament rubber-stamped last week." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4428" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/a028e497ebb2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Italy's prime minister Giorgia Meloni is suing a man and his father for creating and circulating a pornographic deepfake video of her." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4446" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/54ed4c5a7345> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Meanwhile, last year, actor Rashmika Mandanna fell prey to a deepfake video where her face was morphed on the body of British-Indian influencer Zara Patel." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4438" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6244a2d8b4f0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Earlier, deepfake pornographic images of popstar Taylor Swift sent shockwaves through the internet, prompting the White House to call it \"alarming\"." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4435" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/bcf265b25d4b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Italy... also being the first country in Europe to temporarily ban OpenAI's ChatGPT until certain privacy concerns were addressed." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4429" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c9bb0558e91a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Allegedly, a 40-year-old individual created these videos by digitally overlaying Meloni's face onto explicit content, with his 73-year-old father also implicated in the investigation." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4439" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e6feb08dfadc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A 40-year-old man, thought to have produced the videos, and his 73-year-old father are under investigation." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4433" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fdc102474ef2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Those videos were viewed \"millions of times\" on a United States-based porn website, according to Italian news agency ANSA.",
        "Those videos were viewed \"millions of times\" on a United States-based porn website." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4432" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/47fc8f7171d3> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "2 unnamed men, 1 age 40 and his 73-year-old father, are accused of defamation after investigators say they created pornography videos featuring Meloni by placing her face on someone else's body and then posting them online, the BBC reported.",
        "2 unnamed men, 1 age 40 and his 73-year-old father, are accused of defamation after investigators say they created pornography videos featuring Meloni by placing her face on someone else's body and then posting them online.",
        "2 unnamed men, 1 age 40 and his 73-year-old father, are accused of defamation after investigators say they created pornography videos featuring Meloni." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4432" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/27534cb47c01> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Meloni is seeking compensation from a 40-year-old and his 73-year-old father over the deepfake pornographic videos, which were uploaded to an American porn website in 2020 (before she became PM) and viewed millions of times, according to the indictment, the BBC reported." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4428" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/9bc879763351> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Fake pornographic images of Emma Watson, Kristen Bell and Taylor Swift, among others, have gone viral, sometimes being seen millions of times before platforms remove the content." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4436" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c6fdfa7ba4ce> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Some American states have created laws to address the issue of pornographic deepfakes, including California, Florida, New York and Texas." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6678" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/59de37ba482d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Furthermore, large tech platforms like TikTok, X, and Facebook must identify AI-generated content under the Digital Services Act, part of the EU's content moderation laws." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4427" .

