<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4257a989de84> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Kristen Bell spoke out after her face was featured in deep fake porn in 2020, and other victims have included Natalie Portman, Gal Gadot, Michelle Obama and Kate Middleton." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6678" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6530c4c72ee6> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Several celebrities, including Rashmika Mandanna, Alia Bhatt, Katrina Kaif, Priyanka Chopra, Sachin Tendulkar and Virat Kohli have fallen victim to the altered photographs." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4435" .

